@baseUrl = https://localhost:44348

# @name bearer
POST {{baseUrl}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials
&client_id=globalAdminServicePrincipal
&client_secret=globalAdminServicePrincipal
&scope=fhir-api

###

# Idempotent PUTs of an unchanged resource are a no-op ("Update operation resulted
# in no changes"), which skips the merge and therefore skips write-time vector
# indexing. Hard-delete the vector-bearing resources so the next run of
# 02-ingest-and-index.http recreates them and populates dbo.VectorSearchParam.
# Binaries are left in place; DocumentReference indexing resolves their text.

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Observation/demo-obs-exact-presyncope?hardDelete=true
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer.response.body.access_token}}

###

